   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Hi, <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">I’m working on a project about population change in Spain. I’m creating\r\nan shinyapp where to show some dynamic plots and allow data download to users.\r\nThe thing is the app takes too long to upload. I guess this has to be related\r\n(in some part) with the size of the datasets I’m using, but this is only my\r\nfeeling, as I don’t really understand how the cloud thing works. Is there any\r\nway to solve this? Upgrading my free Shinyapps account?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Here the url of a work-in-progress version:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://gedemced.shinyapps.io/DP_CATALONIA/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gedemced.shinyapps.io/DP_CATALONIA/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792364161210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2PcM2TA3Y1jBYRVe4YXMYA\">https://gedemced.shinyapps.io/DP_CATALONIA/</a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">The app is about population composition in CATALONIA but I would\r\nlike to create one for each Spanish Autonomous Community (17). Before\r\ncontinuing I would like to know more about the limitations of the service, to\r\nadapt my development strategy.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">For this app I’m using 3 Rdata files, hosted on our web server, of\r\nsizes 7.6 MB,0.91 MB and 0.17 M<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Thanks in advanced<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:12pt;line-height:14.55pt;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Juan Galeano<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p></div>"
